+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. The only decision record that existed for this topic (`config/decisions/revoke-version-scheme.json`) was removed from the repository in commit `fe09af8` ("move decision config out of the tree"), and no replacement decision has been recorded since; until a new decision is recorded, no version numbering scheme should be assumed or implemented on its authority.
